  message: "Dogfood correction of the symptom framing. metrics.languages.<lang> carries ONLY {nodes, edges} — there is NO files key on any of the 18 entries (producer metrics.py:92/100 writes only {nodes, edges}). So the files key is ABSENT, not 0: a consumer reading metrics.languages.<lang>.files gets nothing (key missing), and any documentation asserting files=0 there is false because the field does not exist. Separately, profile.languages.<lang> (the only languages block with a files key, ={files, loc}) has files NON-ZERO for ALL 18 entries (python 852, yaml 174, markdown 113, bash 42, json/toml 9, typescript 8, others 1; producer profile.py:792). The fix (wire metrics.languages files, or harmonize the two blocks) is unchanged; the symptom statement should read 'files key absent from metrics.languages' rather than 'files=0'."  # 273e
